## Name of the node
-sname ersub

## Cookie for distributed erlang
-setcookie ersub_cookie

## Enable SMP
-smp auto

## Increase process limit
+P 1048576

## Increase port limit
+Q 65536

## Increase atom limit
+t 1048576

## Scheduler settings
+K true
+A 64

## GC settings
+hms 8192

## Kernel poll
+K true
